    "inclusion_criteria": "Consenting 16–45-year-old patients; met Structured Clinical Interview for DSM-IV criteria for schizophrenia, schizophreniform disorder, or schizoaffective disorder for no more than 1 year during which period they had no more than two psychiatric hospitalizations for psychosis; had less than 12 weeks of cumulative exposure to antipsychotics and required antipsychotic treatment upon enrollment.",
